WEBVTT

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:30.136
And everywhere I go around the nation,

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:34.039
I see and hear the hurt.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.655
And I ask people everywhere,

00:08:37.679 --> 00:08:40.200
"Tell me, where does it hurt?"

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:45.096
Do you see and feel the hurt

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.840
that I see and feel?

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:55.200
I feel and see the hurt
in black and brown people

00:08:55.880 --> 00:09:02.480
who every day feel
the vicious volley of racism